          "stableAnchor": "h-482ecc819c4c"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "D1 — Check `mergeHeadExists` BEFORE the `git merge --no-commit --no-ff` call, not only after",
          "anchor": "d1-check-mergeheadexists-before-the-git-merge---no-commit---no-ff-call-not-only-after",
          "githubAnchor": "d1-check-mergeheadexists-before-the-git-merge---no-commit---no-ff-call-not-only-after",
          "stableAnchor": "h-617f9b5eeb77"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "D2 — New outcome, retryable via `fgos catchup`, following `tsk-18a`'s own precedent exactly",
          "anchor": "d2-new-outcome-retryable-via-fgos-catchup-following-tsk-18as-own-precedent-exactly",
          "githubAnchor": "d2-new-outcome-retryable-via-fgos-catchup-following-tsk-18as-own-precedent-exactly",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e0ae0f9e7197"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "D3 — Never call `abortMergeIfPossible` on a pre-existing MERGE_HEAD",
          "anchor": "d3-never-call-abortmergeifpossible-on-a-pre-existing-merge_head",
          "githubAnchor": "d3-never-call-abortmergeifpossible-on-a-pre-existing-merge_head",
          "stableAnchor": "h-865264ae49c6"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "D4 — `sync-root`'s call site (`bin/fgos.mjs:3305-3357`) gets a defensive unrecognized-outcome guard, not a named `merge-blocked-other-item` branch",
          "anchor": "d4-sync-roots-call-site-binfgosmjs3305-3357-gets-a-defensive-unrecognized-outcome-guard-not-a-named-merge-blocked-other-item-branch",
          "githubAnchor": "d4-sync-roots-call-site-binfgosmjs3305-3357-gets-a-defensive-unrecognized-outcome-guard-not-a-named-merge-blocked-other-item-branch",
