          "text": "The steps",
          "anchor": "the-steps",
          "githubAnchor": "the-steps",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e98d4845550e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Trap: a root's own branch can advance again AFTER you've already synced it to `main` once",
