          "text": "Produce failing-test-first proof for an Iron Law-gated diff",
          "anchor": "produce-failing-test-first-proof-for-an-iron-law-gated-diff",
          "githubAnchor": "produce-failing-test-first-proof-for-an-iron-law-gated-diff",
