          "githubAnchor": "why-plugin-only-installs-could-not-reach-fgoss-coding-domain-dev-skills",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a62843ada881"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Root cause: two separate skill families, only one shipped in the plugin",
          "anchor": "root-cause-two-separate-skill-families-only-one-shipped-in-the-plugin",
          "githubAnchor": "root-cause-two-separate-skill-families-only-one-shipped-in-the-plugin",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ab8ec8785562"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the tempting runtime fallback was rejected",
