          "stableAnchor": "h-b6aea207ec55"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The fix: a third enforced mirror, not a second manually-maintained one",
          "anchor": "the-fix-a-third-enforced-mirror-not-a-second-manually-maintained-one",
          "githubAnchor": "the-fix-a-third-enforced-mirror-not-a-second-manually-maintained-one",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d4fb85300cfb"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why this belongs to mission #1/#2, not #3",
