          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why `fgos review` crashed with ENOBUFS on very stale branch diffs",
          "anchor": "why-fgos-review-crashed-with-enobufs-on-very-stale-branch-diffs",
          "githubAnchor": "why-fgos-review-crashed-with-enobufs-on-very-stale-branch-diffs",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1f42cd3cdfd6"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Root cause: a missing `maxBuffer`, not a special case for staleness",
          "anchor": "root-cause-a-missing-maxbuffer-not-a-special-case-for-staleness",
          "githubAnchor": "root-cause-a-missing-maxbuffer-not-a-special-case-for-staleness",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6d633a84c674"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the fix does both of the item's own \"either/or\" options instead of picking one",
          "anchor": "why-the-fix-does-both-of-the-items-own-eitheror-options-instead-of-picking-one",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-fix-does-both-of-the-items-own-eitheror-options-instead-of-picking-one",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c818df0795c8"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the fix stayed narrow despite `git()` being a CRITICAL-risk shared primitive",
          "anchor": "why-the-fix-stayed-narrow-despite-git-being-a-critical-risk-shared-primitive",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-fix-stayed-narrow-despite-git-being-a-critical-risk-shared-primitive",
          "stableAnchor": "h-771b856d7c1b"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Scope correction: `approve` was never actually affected",
          "anchor": "scope-correction-approve-was-never-actually-affected",
          "githubAnchor": "scope-correction-approve-was-never-actually-affected",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a910b727b391"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Related",
