          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why the gateway edit route reuses EDITABLE_FIELDS and passes through `fgos edit`'s refusal",
          "anchor": "why-the-gateway-edit-route-reuses-editable_fields-and-passes-through-fgos-edits-refusal",
