          "stableAnchor": "h-1f98eb95a44e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the same physical file runs for both",
          "anchor": "why-the-same-physical-file-runs-for-both",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-same-physical-file-runs-for-both",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ce51f31542e3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The original lock hazard never involved worktrees at all",
