          "githubAnchor": "the-asymmetry-that-gave-it-away",
          "stableAnchor": "h-49e14f73a778"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The fix: tell \"away from home\" apart from \"at home\"",
          "anchor": "the-fix-tell-away-from-home-apart-from-at-home",
          "githubAnchor": "the-fix-tell-away-from-home-apart-from-at-home",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c534087529d7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What stays true either way",
          "anchor": "what-stays-true-either-way",
