          "text": "HIGH — `executeAssignment`'s own `effectiveAssignment` re-read (`assignment-runner.mjs:538-559/607/883`) has no `mutation` backfill either, and a stale/legacy `.fgos/assignments/<id>/assignment.json` at the SAME assignmentId defeats even the already-fixed `mission-lite.mjs`/`cli.mjs` callers",
